### Plex development source

- For Plex, use only this project's `.agents/skills/plex/SKILL.md` and
  `.agents/skills/plex-setup/SKILL.md`.
- Do not activate global or cached plugin copies of these two skills, or fall back
  to them if the project links are missing.
- Resolve these skill symlinks to their real paths first. Their shared checkout root
  contains `skills/` and `teams/`; read the checker, references, selected coordinator
  and team resources only from that same checkout.
- A missing link or incomplete source is a blocker.
- This source restriction applies to Plex's two skills. BMad workflows still use
  their separately installed official skills and project runtime.
